WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.840
Starting from today, we shall...

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.940
Turn back into normal girls.

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:58.380
Goodbye, Maho-dou.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:14.900
Doremi...

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.950
We have to erase their memories using magic.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.800
That's forbidden magic.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.330
You know you'll get punished for doing that.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.870
W-W-W-Why are you all here?

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.120
I saw it all.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.330
I saw you flying in the sky with that broom!

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:33.290
Oh no...

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:34.750
Are you girls...

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.470
Don't tell me...

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:46.720
We are...

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:48.520
Going to become...

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.480
Witch Frogs...

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:52.770
At this rate, everyone will...

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.570
I'll use it just one more time.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.860
Wi...

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:06.580
Pururun Purun Famifami Faa!

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.290
Stop!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:11.250
Erase everyone's memories of today!

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:25.050
Mother!
Baaya!
Dad!

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.100
They just fell unconscious, that's all.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.560
Onpu, you...

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:29.600
Now, let's hurry inside.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.060
Onpu-chan.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.270
Don't worry, don't worry.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.740
Hurry and close the door.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.490
Onpu-chan did that for us...

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:50.830
Hey... I just saw Onpu-chan's bracelet...

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.540
It looks like it's broken.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.920
What!?

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:58.630
Onpu-chan!

00:03:58.630 --> 00:03:59.670
What happened!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.760
What's wrong? Onpu-chan!

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.680
What happened to Onpu-chan?

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:09.020
Girls, change your clothes now!

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:09.720
Eh!?

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:12.730
What is this place?

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:18.610
Mom...

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:19.480
Doremi...

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:19.980
Aiko!

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:20.650
Hadzuki-chan...

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.150
The Maho-dou?

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:24.660
Why are we here?

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.660
It feels like... my memories are all blank.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.120
Did you girls wake up here too?

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:34.540
What's wrong?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.000
Mom...

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:41.420
Onpu-chan's...

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.470
Onpu-chan!

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:51.390
There are no visible wounds, and there is nothing wrong with her body.

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.810
Then she's fine?

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:58.190
Well, she hasn't regained consciousness.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.230
What happened to her?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.190
The doctor said that she's just sleeping.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.030
Just sleeping?

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:09.620
Anyway, leave this to your teacher.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.040
Please go home, everyone.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.160
But...

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.410
We'll only get in the way here.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:22.090
In any case, what a bizarre day.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.170
Yeah.

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:30.810
Doremi-chan!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:32.890
You two...

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:34.350
Let's go to the Maho-dou.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:35.020
Okay.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:39.860
So...

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:43.650
It's because she kept using forbidden magic.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:44.860
10 years...

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.660
No, she may take 20 years to wake up.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:54.620
So you mean... I'm stuck as a Witch Frog?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:00.210
We couldn't do anything to wake her up!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:03.170
Yeah, yeah! I don't want this!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.260
Okay!

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:06.420
In that case...

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.680
We have to go ask the Queen fer help!

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:11.140
That's it!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:20.350
If Onpu-chan does not awaken within 24 hours,

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.020
then she is to sleep for 100 years.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.320
Eh!?

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.320
100 years?

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.450
That long?

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:29.280
That's too long.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:33.740
As she used forbidden magic, I cannot do anything.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:35.870
Your Majesty!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.250
Please, save Onpu-chan!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.540
Please!

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.170
Your Majesty!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.140
I cannot.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:55.140
Even as the Queen, I cannot go against the laws of the Witch World.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.480
Your Majesty...

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:01.100
When Onpu-chan passed the level 1 exam...

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.270
Onpu-chan.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:04.900
What?

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:08.820
You didn't use magic to alter people's thoughts during the exam.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:09.700
Yeah.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.160
How do you feel?

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.490
I feel nice!

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:24.670
That's why I don't think she planned on using that magic ever again.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:25.670
Yes!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:28.670
She used it to save us!

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.170
Please!

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:35.140
If she sleeps for 100 years, she won't be able to see her parents anymore...

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.720
That's so sad for Onpu-chan!

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:41.270
We can do anything you ask us!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.560
Please, save her somehow!

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:46.770
Please!

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.110
Please...

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.110
There is one way.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.570
Your Majesty!

00:07:53.280 --> 00:08:00.250
If you use Magical Stage with your Crystals, you may be able to wake her up.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.620
Magical Stage...

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:07.920
But the power level of your magic may not be enough.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:12.090
Should you fail, your Crystals may break instead.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.010
Eh?

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:16.600
But there's a chance!

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:17.510
Yes.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.180
There's one more thing.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:24.810
Whether you succeed or not, you will forfeit being witches.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:34.240
If you agree to that, then bring Onpu-chan here and cast Magical Stage.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:38.410
You have 18 hours remaining.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.370
Please think carefully about it.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:43.910
You idiots!

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:48.380
Didn't you all work your butts off this year just to become witches?

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.460
Yeah, but...

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.010
This is all Onpu's fault!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.930
She finally gets her retribution!

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:56.010
No way!

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:01.850
Do you... really want to do this?

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:05.810
The Queen told us to think carefully about it.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:12.280
Well, let me turn back first, at the very least.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:14.280
Oh yeah!

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:19.980
If I turn back, I don't care whether you all stay witches or not.

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:22.080
Why are you only thinking about yourself?

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:22.870
Cut the talk.

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:24.830
Turn me back right now!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.290
Leave it to me.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:32.250
Why is your Crystal so small? Will this really work...

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.420
You want me to do this or not?

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:35.380
Aaaahhhh!

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.930
Of course, just turn me back!

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.180
Alright, sure thing.

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:41.640
Okay, here I go.

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:46.810
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:51.650
Turn Majo Rika back to her original form!

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.320
I'm back, I'm back!

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:10.420
So that's Majo Rika.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.550
How nostalgic...

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.050
N-No way... Why?

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:24.720
Your Crystal is too small, that's why.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.140
No way...

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.230
I'm sorry, Majo Rika.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:31.230
You think an apology can fix this!?

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:36.110
Well, I think yer more Majo Rika-like this way.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:36.860
Yeah.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:39.240
We're all used to it.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.200
Not a chance!!!

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.540
Train more and make your Crystal grow!

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.600
But what about Onpu-chan?

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.320
I don't care, I don't care, I don't care, I don't care, I don't care, I don't care!

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:52.750
You can't give up on being witches before turning me back!

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.000
Do you understand me!?

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.380
What should we do?

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.510
But...

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:05.260
If we do save Onpu-chan, then we can't be witches anymore.

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.270
Oh yeah!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:16.440
I have to part with Dodo if I stop being a witch.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.410
Me too...

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.370
I don't want to leave you!

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.740
No...

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:32.120
Don't cry, Rere.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:37.880
I'm sorry.

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.830
Good morning.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.160
What happened yesterday?

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:12.580
Something super weird happened.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:14.420
I can't remember a thing...

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.580
Why was I sleeping in such a filthy place?

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:18.000
Do you remember anything, Masaru?

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:18.880
Not a thing.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:23.380
Good morning.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.720
I can't remember a thing.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:32.770
I don't want to part with Rere, but...

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:37.860
Hey, we should go to the hospital after school to see Onpu-chan.

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:38.690
Yeah.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.610
So many people...

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:45.280
Just like an idol...

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.120
It'll be hard to get inside.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:49.450
Well then, let's transform.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:51.080
Okay, let's do that.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:54.710
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.210
Turn us all into butterflies!

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:00.170
Let's get goin'.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.460
Okay.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.060
It's all my fault...

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.980
I forced my dreams onto you...

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.360
You overworked yourself...

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:21.100
I'm sorry, Onpu-chan.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:25.700
Please wake up!

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:37.580
Onpu-chan probably became a witch apprentice to fulfill her mother's dreams.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.000
I didn't know.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.480
I can kinda understand how she feels though.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:46.180
Hey, Hadzuki-chan, Ai-chan.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.300
Why did you want to become witches?

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:54.770
I was alway relying on my parents too much, so I wanted to change myself.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:59.770
Ai-chan, did you want to mend your parents' relationship?

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:06.740
Well, that's the best outcome, but I only wanted my dad to quit workin' so hard.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.450
Doremi-chan, how about you?

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:13.370
Well, I wanted the courage to confess to someone I like.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.160
That's my Doremi-chan.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:18.210
But...

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.130
I think that...

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:24.380
we can do all that without magic.

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.550
Yeah.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:26.590
You're right.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:30.970
Even if we're not witches, we can use our own powers.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.510
I ain't alone either.

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:35.220
The both of ya are there fer me.

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.850
And Onpu-chan is our friend, too.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.650
Hadzuki-chan.

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:41.520
Then it's decided.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:42.820
Yep, that's right.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.780
We'll help Onpu-chan.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:48.200
I'm sure Majo Rika will understand.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:55.910
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.370
Let time stop!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:17.770
Majo Rika!

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:18.980
Majo Rika?

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.350
Are ya here?

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:21.730
You're so loud.

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:22.810
I'm right here.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.070
What are you doing?

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:28.570
Majo Rika, um...

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:29.950
You've decided?

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.450
Listen, Majo Rika.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.820
It's about Onpu-chan...

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:36.580
I know.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:41.790
I've been with you Ojamajos for a whole year already.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.210
I already knew you'd choose this path.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:46.550
Is that okay?

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.960
Hurry up. Time's running out.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:50.420
Right!

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.060
Thank you, Majo Rika.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.310
Those Ojamajos...

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:07.020
They're too nice.

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:09.030
They aren't fit to be witches.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:12.200
But, that's their good point too, I suppose.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:14.030
You too, Majo Rika.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:20.410
Just like magic, Segawa Onpu-san, the popular idol, suddenly disappeared from her hospital bed.

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.540
It must be Doremi's doing!

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:23.120
Just like magic, Segawa Onpu-san, the popular idol, suddenly disappeared from her hospital bed.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.880
Are you prepared?

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.250
Yes, ma'am.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:32.340
Then, let's start.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:32.670
Yes.

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:35.340
We hafta succeed, 'cause this'll be our last spell.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:38.350
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:42.810
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:46.860
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.570
Magical Stage!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.910
Awaken Onpu-chan from her slumber!

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:23.640
Oh no!

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:24.730
Onpu-chan!

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:26.440
Wake up!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:30.320
Pipitto Puritto Puritan Peperuto!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.190
Pop!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.860
Pop-chan!

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.240
I'll help too!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:39.580
But you'll also have to quit being a witch apprentice too!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:42.240
And ya don't have a Crystal either!

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.580
That's fine! I want to help!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:47.670
Because I love Onpu-chan,

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.710
I want to help her!

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.380
Okay! Please help us, Pop!

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.400
Okay!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:58.260
Awaken Onpu-chan from her slumber!

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:14.110
No way...

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:30.040
Stop! Your Crystals are at their limits!

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:32.630
But, but, Onpu-chan is still...

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:35.130
No! We won't give up!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.590
We must, we must, we must save her!

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:40.050
Yeah! We ain't gonna give up!

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:44.850
Please! Let Onpu-chan awaken from her slumber!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:30.480
I...

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.150
What am I doing here?

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:41.240
Thank goodness!

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:44.160
Onpu-chan, thank goodness...

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:46.910
Onpu-chan.

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:52.500
Because you used forbidden magic, you were made to sleep for 100 years.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:55.250
Doremi-chan and the others saved you.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:58.210
Is that what happened?

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:00.760
Thank you, everyone.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:12.360
Now then, please return your Crystals and your Poron.

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:15.190
You too must relinquish being a witch, Onpu-chan.

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.230
Is that okay?

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:16.650
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:45.360
Your instruments shall now return to your rooms.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:51.060
You are now no longer witches.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:20.300
We will probably not see each other again.

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:20.800
Goodbye.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:27.390
It's over.

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:28.510
Yeah...

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:38.730
What are you doing?

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:41.190
We're closing up shop, so I'm packing up.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:48.070
Since I can't turn back, there's no point in keeping a store.

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:48.990
Majo Rika...

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:50.080
We're...

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.160
It's the best for everyone.

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:55.040
Plush-chan, I don't want that!

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:57.040
I don't want that!

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.130
I don't want to bother you girls!

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:07.090
You might be Ojamajos, but you're just like daughters to me.

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:09.220
I'll be taking Dodo and the others.

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:12.760
We'll take care of them, so don't worry.

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:14.560
We'll come pick up Roro later too.

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:16.770
Um...

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:17.600
Where's Majo Ruka?

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:21.900
She got really upset after hearing that she'd be stuck as a Witch Frog.

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:25.190
She's probably at the Village of Witch Frogs.

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:26.820
You don't need to worry about us.

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:28.990
Now, you're all tired, right?

00:22:28.990 --> 00:22:31.320
Get back home and go get some rest.

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:32.450
Okay.

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:39.290
I guess that's it fer the Maho-dou.

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:42.750
I had so many wonderful experiences here, though.

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:46.300
I wanted to use some more magic.

00:22:46.300 --> 00:22:48.550
I'm sorry, this is all because of me.

00:22:48.550 --> 00:22:49.300
No, no.

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:53.260
We didn't turn into Witch Frogs thanks to you.

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:54.560
We all helped each other.

00:22:54.560 --> 00:22:55.310
Yep, yep.

00:22:55.310 --> 00:22:59.770
And I'd rather have Onpu-chan back instead of having magic.

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:02.730
Nicely said, Pop.

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:04.360
Yeah.

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:08.650
Even though we can't use magic anymore, we're good friends now.

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:10.860
Doremi-chan, we aren't just good friends.

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:12.370
Yeah, we're all...

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:14.240
the best of friends!
